<report>
<title>Comparison of two directly standardized rates</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th colspan="4">Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</th><td></td></tr>
<block name="strata"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@a</td><td>@pt1</td><td>@b</td><td>@pt2</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Rate ratio</th><th colspan="2"><ci>@{pc:round2}% CI (@method)</ci></th><th>Weight</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="rates"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{rr:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{uci:roundu}</ci></td><td>@{wt:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p>Analysis model for rates: @model_out<br />
Rates are expressed per @units of person time:</p>

<p>Crude rate exposed = @{cre:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact @{pc:round2}% CI = @{cre_from:roundu}  to  @{cre_to:roundu}@{cre_warn}</ci></p>

<p>Crude rate not exposed = @{crne:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact @{pc:round2}% CI = @{crne_from:roundu}  to  @{crne_to:roundu}@{crne_warn}</ci></p>

<p>Standardized rate exposed = @{sre:roundu}<br />
<ci>Approximate @{pc:round2}% CI = @{sre_from:roundu}  to  @{sre_to:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Standardized rate not exposed = @{srne:roundu}<br />
<ci>Approximate @{pc:round2}% CI = @{srne_from:roundu}  to  @{srne_to:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Standardized rate ratio = @{srr:roundu}<br />
<ci>Approximate @{pc:round2}% CI = @{srr_from:roundu}  to  @{srr_to:roundu}</ci></p>
</report>
